<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending January 18, 1997, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  1-18-97		 340000	    254.3</p>
<p>week ending:  1-11-97		 335000	    255.1</p>
<p>year ago:     1-20-96		 323000	    250.8</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
